{"4627230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GRAV Fishing", "steam_appid": 4627230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fish the Cosmos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAV Fishing is a mini-open world fishing game but instead of catching fish in the water the goal is to fish them out of orbit and return them to their ocean planet home.<br><br>Every fish on Aquaria has floated into space. Armed with an experimental gravity rod, it’s your job to catch them, clear them of graviton barnacles, and return them to the water. <br> <br>Fill out constellations (collections of floating fish), catch special species variants and return all of Aquaria's many residents to their ocean home. Challenge yourself to catch the biggest, fastest and rarest fish..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviton barnacles are an invasive species that refuses to play by the laws of physics. Over exposure to these exotic critters can lead to unexpected side effects and the fish are covered in them. It is your job to remove them using your graviton beam as a cleaning tool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/db4f6d0cf7b0abfad52426cfd64bff5a.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=98 /></span> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools run on graviton energy — harvested from the very parasites that you extract. Upgrade your loadout and push further into the skies and depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Aquaria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you restore the absent marine life, Aquaria will begin to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike to higher ground or plunge beneath the waves to track down specific species. Different fish prefer different habitats but none of them enjoy space. You will need to explore all of this mini-open world to rescue each and every fish from their floaty fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌏 Mini open world - traverse the ocean planet surface to reach higher ground or explore below the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐠 Fish floating fish out of the upper atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Restore the ecosystem – return fish to the ocean and return life to Aquaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Clear pesky graviton barnacles from the infected fish and planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Upgrade your gear to cast further, explore deeper and fly higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ Hook wayward asteroids to mine their riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐡 Clear planetoid sized aquatic friends, of big bouncing barnacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Low stakes, relaxing gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Fish the Cosmos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAV Fishing is a mini-open world fishing game but instead of catching fish in the water the goal is to fish them out of orbit and return them to their ocean planet home.<br><br>Every fish on Aquaria has floated into space. Armed with an experimental gravity rod, it’s your job to catch them, clear them of graviton barnacles, and return them to the water. <br> <br>Fill out constellations (collections of floating fish), catch special species variants and return all of Aquaria's many residents to their ocean home. Challenge yourself to catch the biggest, fastest and rarest fish..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/21ec665c9b2a80737ea38eab22bf546e.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graviton barnacles are an invasive species that refuses to play by the laws of physics. Over exposure to these exotic critters can lead to unexpected side effects and the fish are covered in them. It is your job to remove them using your graviton beam as a cleaning tool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/db4f6d0cf7b0abfad52426cfd64bff5a.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=98 /></span> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools run on graviton energy — harvested from the very parasites that you extract. Upgrade your loadout and push further into the skies and depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/dd8014d0a83ca6b70b4b9dcb74cbb7e4.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Aquaria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you restore the absent marine life, Aquaria will begin to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike to higher ground or plunge beneath the waves to track down specific species. Different fish prefer different habitats but none of them enjoy space. You will need to explore all of this mini-open world to rescue each and every fish from their floaty fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/112acfeb97321141b51f7c6fdd53bff7.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.poster.avif?t=1785100027\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.webm?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/6d47c898e2d15289c0232dab9a2a739b.mp4?t=1785100027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/extras/2bf000efb144878743ae0bd4f18cff00.webp?t=1785100027\" width=512 height=19 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌏 Mini open world - traverse the ocean planet surface to reach higher ground or explore below the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐠 Fish floating fish out of the upper atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Restore the ecosystem – return fish to the ocean and return life to Aquaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Clear pesky graviton barnacles from the infected fish and planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Upgrade your gear to cast further, explore deeper and fly higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ Hook wayward asteroids to mine their riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐡 Clear planetoid sized aquatic friends, of big bouncing barnacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Low stakes, relaxing gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A relaxing fishing adventure where the fish have floated into space. Explore Aquaria, rescue floating sea life with your gravity rod, and restore the planet’s lost ecosystem.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/62a594de96b667db3dd381cab66ba1807ab1c6dd/header.jpg?t=1785100027", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/c45efde365af7a183b8ce1f6eea6666974b560c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785100027", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627230/c45efde365af7a183b8ce1f6eea6666974b560c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=